# Hasbro's BATTLESHIP: 100% Achievement Guide

**Author:** the_jzilla
**Original Steam Guide:** [Link to Steam](https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3816696462)

A simple guide that describes in depth how to get all the achievements in Battleship.

---

## Tips for 100% Completion

Here are some quick tips on getting to 100% quicker. I suggest playing based on the following priorities:

1. **Collect Medals:** Prioritize acquiring medals early. Your primary objective is reaching the 128-medal threshold as efficiently as possible. Other Achievements will unlock without much effort while collecting medals.
2. **Commander, Never Classic:** Bypass Classic mode. Commander abilities drastically reduce match time. Utilize alternate maps to accelerate gameplay.
3. **Take advantage of Single Player games:** Set to Easy if you're just looking to get your destroyed ship counter up. More on this below.

### Farming 1,000 Destroyed Ships
After securing all specialized achievements, default to Single Player (Easy) to grind the remaining ship kills.

> **Reminder:** Every match yields a maximum of 5 destroyed ships.

---

## Achievements

### Welcome, Commander
**How to Obtain:** Rank up for the first time. Complete standard matches to accumulate XP. You will get this early in your progression.

### It's a hit!
**How to Obtain:** Hit a ship four times in a row. Locate a 4-peg (Battleship) or 5-peg (Carrier) vessel. Once orientation is confirmed, fire sequential shots down the axis. Do not deviate.

### Success is no accident
**How to Obtain:** Get a score of 300 points or more. Minimize missed shots and utilize Commander abilities to maximize hit density and you will get over 300+ points.
*Note: It is possible to combine this with: "Top of the class"*

### Top of the class
**How to Obtain:** Achieve 50% accuracy in a single game. Play in Commanders mode. Deploy Sonar to verify coordinates before firing. Execute shots only when data confirms a target.
*Note: It is possible to combo this one with "Success is no accident"*

### Mission accomplished
**How to Obtain:** Win a game on Hard difficulty. The Hard AI optimizes its search patterns. Counter this by spreading your fleet to the perimeter and utilizing high-yield Commanders.

### Ship sunk!
**How to Obtain:** Sink 100 ships. This will come on the path to "Supremacy at sea".

### Triumph is not an easy task
**How to Obtain:** Win a game on Hard difficulty. Set the PC player to "Hard" in Single Player and win the game.

### It's the will, not the skill
**How to Obtain:** Collect 38 medals. Medals are provided in 1 - 3 increments. This will fill without much work as you play games - just pay attention to when it calls for Single vs Online games.

### All in, all the time
**How to Obtain:** Win 10 games on hard difficulty. Grind requirement. Recommend running Commanders mode and exploit Sonar advantages.

### Leave no ship afloat!
**How to Obtain:** Destroy 500 ships. This is another grind, but compliments the achievements that require medal earnings and winning games.

### Supremacy at sea
**How to Obtain:** Win 100 games. Another grind. Just keep winning games until you reach 100. This should be achieved in advance of achieving "No ship in sight!"

### No ship in sight!
**How to Obtain:** Destroy 1000 ships. This is by the far the most time consuming Achievement. It is highly likely this will be the final outstanding Achievement in your 100% journey.
